year, for example 21 April 2026). Never use month-first dates.\n8. If a task has overdue_days above 0, say it is overdue by that many days. Do not describe it as on track.\n9. Say the sprint is complete only if sprint_complete is true. Otherwise say how many tasks are done and what remains.\n10. Output the JSON object and nothing else.""},{""role"":""user"",""content"":""{\""audience\"":\""leadership\"",\""sprint\"":\""Sprint 2\"",\""as_of\"":\""24 April 2026\"",\""sprint_complete\"":false,\""counts\"":{\""Done\"":2,\""In Progress\"":1,\""To Do\"":0,\""Blocked\"":0,\""Total\"":3},\""tasks\"":[{\""id\"":\""T004\"",\""name\"":\""Audit existing data infrastructure\"",\""status\"":\""Done\"",\""owner\"":\""Priya Nair\"",\""due\"":\""18 April 2026\"",\""overdue_days\"":0},{\""id\"":\""T005\"",\""name\"":\""Map current logistics workflows\"",\""status\"":\""Done\"",\""owner\"":\""James Wong\"",\""due\"":\""18 April 2026\"",\""overdue_days\"":0},{\""id\"":\""T006\"",\""name\"":\""Identify data gaps and quality issues\"",\""status\"":\""In Progress\"",\""owner\"":\""Priya Nair\"",\""due\"":\""21 April 2026\"",\""overdue_days\"":3}]}""}]","{""subject"":""Sprint 2 Update"",""greeting"":""Dear Team,"",""paragraphs"":[""As of 24 April 2026, we have completed Sprint 2 with 2 tasks done and 1 task still in progress. The completed tasks include 'Audit existing data infrastructure' (T004) and 'Map current logistics workflows' (T005), both of which were due on 18 April 2026."",""The remaining task, 'Identify data gaps and quality issues' (T006), is currently in progress and is overdue by 3 days. We will continue to monitor its status closely.""],""closing"":""Best regards,""}","{""status"":""ok"",""cost_usd"":""0.000169"",""scope.name"":""mira-n8n"",""resourceAttributes.service.name"":""mira"",""attributes.gen_ai.usage.output_tokens"":""128"",""attributes.gen_ai.usage.input_tokens"":""613"",""attributes.gen_ai.request.model"":""gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18"",""attributes.langfuse.session.