and forecasting), not tools or technologies.\n3. Every objective needs an \""evidence\"" value copied exactly from the description. If you cannot copy a supporting phrase, leave that objective out.\n4. Copy phases, weeks, activities and milestones exactly from \""timeline\"". Do not add, rename or merge phases. If \""timeline\"" is empty, return \""phases\"": [] and list \""timeline\"" in information_gaps.\n5. Put every planning fact that the sources do not state into \""information_gaps\"" (for example budget, team size, named owners), instead of guessing it.\n6. VAGUE INPUT RULE: If the description is empty, or too thin to say what is being built, for whom, by when and with what scope, return \""sufficient\"": false, list what is missing (scope, goals, deliverables, timeline, team size) and leave all other fields empty. Do NOT write a plan from one sentence.\n7. Output the JSON object and nothing else.""},{""role"":""user"",""content"":""{\""description\"":\""AI Adoption Project Description for ABCDE Ltd.\\n\\nABCDE Ltd., a mid-sized enterprise specializing in logistics and supply chain solutions, is embarking on an AI adoption initiative to enhance operational efficiency, improve customer experience, and drive data-driven decision-making across the organization. This project will focus on integrating AI-powered tools into core business functions, including demand forecasting, route optimization, inventory management, and customer support. By leveraging machine learning models and natural language processing, the company aims to reduce manual overhead, minimize errors, and uncover actionable insights from historical and real-time data.\\n\\nThe AI adoption project will be implemented in phases, beginning with a detailed assessment of current workflows and data infrastructure, followed by pilot implementations in targeted departments. Key goals include reducing delivery delays by 15%, lowering operational costs by 10%, and improving service responsiveness. A cross-functional task force comprising data scientists, IT professionals, and business stakeholders will oversee the deployment and ensure alignment with organizational objectives. This strategic move is expected to position ABCDE Ltd. as a technology-forward leader in the logistics industry.\"",\""timeline\"":[{\""phase\"":1,\""name\"":\""Project Initiation\"",\""start_week\"":1,\""end_week\"":2,\""activities\"":[\""Define project scope\"",\""Form cross-functional team\"",\""Initial stakeholder meeting\""],\""milestones\"":[\""Project charter signed off\"",\""Team structure finalized\""]},{\""phase\"":2,\""name\"":\""Current State Analysis\"",\""start_week\"":3,\""end_week\"":4,\""activities\"":[\""Assess existing processes & systems\"",\""Identify data sources & gaps\""],\""milestones\"":[\""Current systems audit report\"",\""Gap analysis report\""]},{\""phase\"":3,\""name\"":\""Use Case Selection\"",\""start_week\"":5,\""end_week\"":6,\""activities\"":[\""Shortlist priority AI use cases (forecasting, route optimization)\""],\""milestones\"":[\""Final list of prioritized use cases with success criteria\""]},{\""phase\"":4,\""name\"":\""Pilot Design\"",\""start_week\"":7,\""end_week\"":10,\""activities\"":[\""Data collection & preparation\"",\""Model design and development\""],\""milestones\"":[\""Working prototype models\"",\""Data pipelines established\""]},{\""phase\"":5,\""name\"":\""Pilot Implementation\"",\""start_week\"":11,\""end_week\"":14,\""activities\"":[\""Deploy AI models in test environments\"",\""Monitor performance\""],\""milestones\"":[\""Pilot results report\"",\""User feedback and performance metrics\""]},{\""phase\"":6,\""name\"":\""Evaluation & Iteration\"",\""start_week\"":15,\""end_week\"":16,\""activities\"":[\""Evaluate pilot outcomes\"",\""Adjust models as needed\""],\""milestones\"":[\""Updated models and process refinements\""]},{\""phase\"":7,\""name\"":\""Full Deployment\"",\""start_week\"":17,\""end_week\"":22,\""activities\"":[\""Scale AI models across selected departments\"",\""Train staff\""],\""milestones\"":[\""Full production rollout\"",\""Training sessions completed\""]},{\""phase\"":8,\""name\"":\""Monitoring & Review\"",\""start_week\"":23,\""end_week\"":24,\""activities\"":[\""Continuous performance monitoring\"",\""Final project review\""],\""milestones\"":[\""Project closure report\"",\""Recommendations for future scaling\""]}],\""request\"":\""Generate a project plan for the AI Adoption Project at ABCDE Ltd. Use the provided project description.\""}""}]","{""sufficient"":true,""missing"":[],""project_summary"":""ABCDE Ltd. is embarking on an AI adoption initiative to enhance operational efficiency, improve customer experience, and drive data-driven decision-making across the organization."",""objectives"":[{""text"":""reduce delivery delays by 15%"",""evidence"":""Key goals include reducing delivery delays by 15%""},{""text"":""lowering operational costs by 10%"",""evidence"":""Key goals include lowering operational costs by 10%""},{""text"":""improving service responsiveness"",""evidence"":""Key goals include improving service responsiveness""}],""scope_areas"":[""demand forecasting"",""route optimization"",""inventory management"",""customer support""],""approach"":""The project will focus on integrating AI-powered tools into core business functions. It will be implemented in phases, beginning with a detailed assessment of current workflows and data infrastructure, followed by pilot implementations in targeted departments."",""phases"":[{""phase"":1,""name"":""Project Initiation"",""weeks"":""1-2"",""key_activities"":[""Define project scope"",""Form cross-functional team"",""Initial stakeholder meeting""],""milestones"":[""Project charter signed off"",""Team structure finalized""]},{""phase"":2,""name"":""Current State Analysis"",""weeks"":""3-4"",""key_activities"":[""Assess existing processes & systems"",""Identify data sources & gaps""],""milestones"":[""Current systems audit report