"Assess every risk in the register against the project description and the task board.\""}""}]","{""sufficient"":true,""missing"":[],""assessments"":[{""risk_id"":""R01"",""relevance"":""The project description mentions the importance of data quality for AI model performance, linking it to the risk of incomplete or unstructured data."",""evidence_task_ids"":[""T004"",""T006""]},{""risk_id"":""R02"",""relevance"":""The integration of AI with existing logistics systems is a key focus of the project, highlighting the risk of difficulty integrating AI with legacy systems."",""evidence_task_ids"":[]},{""risk_id"":""R03"",""relevance"":""The project involves a cross-functional task force, indicating a potential risk of lacking internal AI/ML expertise."",""evidence_task_ids"":[""T020""]},{""risk_id"":""R04"",""relevance"":""The project aims to change workflows significantly, which may lead to employee resistance to adopting AI-driven processes."",""evidence_task_ids"":[]},{""risk_id"":""R05"",""relevance"":""The project description does not explicitly mention ethical concerns, but the use of AI raises potential risks of biased models or data privacy violations."",""evidence_task_ids"":[""T025""]},{""risk_id"":""R06"",""relevance"":""The project involves significant AI development, which could lead to underestimating costs and resulting budget constraints."",""evidence_task_ids"":[]},{""risk_id"":""R07"",""relevance"":""Stakeholders may expect immediate results from the AI adoption, which aligns with the risk of unrealistic expectations."",""evidence_task_ids"":[]},{""risk_id"":""R08"",""relevance"":""The project involves deploying AI models, which could lead to model performance drift over time."",""evidence_task_ids"":[]},{""risk_id"":""R09"",""relevance"":""The project description does not address security, but the deployment of AI models introduces risks of adversarial attacks."",""evidence_task_ids"":[""T024""]},{""risk_id"":""R10"",""relevance"":""The project may lead to vendor lock-in if a specific AI platform is heavily relied upon."",""evidence_task_ids"":[]}],""derived_risks"":[],""overall_note"":""The assessment highlights various risks associated with data quality, integration, and employee adoption, which are critical for the success of the AI adoption project.""}","{""status"":""ok"",""cost_usd"":""0.000682"",""scope.name"":""mira-n8n"",""resourceAttributes.service.name"":""mira"",""attributes.gen_ai.usage.output_tokens"":""561"",""attributes.gen_ai.usage.input_tokens"":""2301"",""attributes.gen_ai.request.model"":""gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18"",""attributes.langfuse.session.id"":""90acaa9493d44058aeacccdc6fa33e36"",""attributes.langfuse.trace.name"":""Mira: top_risks"",""attributes.langfuse.observation.type"":""generation""}","6314","","[]","","fe0cd31edf2dc9b0","[]"
