-> status_report\n\""Which tasks are blocked or at risk of missing their deadline?\"" -> at_risk_tasks\n\""Summarize current project status: tasks done, in progress, to do, blocked?\"" -> status_counts\n\""What milestones are coming up in the next 2 weeks?\"" -> upcoming_milestones\n\""Generate a stakeholder update email for Sprint 2 progress.\"" -> stakeholder_update, sprint \""Sprint 2\""\n\nRULES\n1. Classify only. Do not write the plan, report or answer.\n2. Set sprint only if the request names a sprint number. Otherwise null.\n3. Set audience only if the request names one. Otherwise null. Do not guess.\n4. If the request fits none of the labels, use \""unclear\"".\n5. Output the JSON object and nothing else.""},{""role"":""user"",""content"":""How many tasks are Done, In Progress, To Do, and Blocked?""}]","{""intent"":""status_counts"",""sprint"":null,""audience"":null,""reason"":""asks for task status summary with counts""}","{""status"":""ok"",""cost_usd"":""0.000097"",""scope.name"":""mira-n8n"",""resourceAttributes.service.name"":""mira"",""attributes.gen_ai.usage.output_tokens"":""26"",""attributes.gen_ai.usage.input_tokens"":""546"",""attributes.gen_ai.request.model"":""gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18"",""attributes.langfuse.session.id"":""mira-344c92bb"",""attributes.langfuse.trace.name"":""Mira: status_counts"",""attributes.langfuse.observation.type"":""generation""}","1442","","[]","","fa188d366cb168ec","[]"
