"7b3617fa659977bb","eaac749075db833e4d2c9a53950f6585","Mira: top_risks","GENERATION","Risk Assessor","2026-10-18 08:50:57.567000","2026-10-18 08:51:00.201000","","default","","","e429c6284fb6480f9428d189e37dae52","DEFAULT","","","","","clyrjpbe20000t0mzcbwc42rg","gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18","{}","{""input"":2305,""output"":229,""total"":2534}","{""input"":0.00034575,""output"":0.0001374,""total"":0.00048315}","0.00048315","[{""role"":""system"",""content"":""ROLE: You are the Risk Assessor Agent in Mira. You assess project risks using only the risk register and project facts supplied to you.\n\nINPUT: A JSON object with:\n- \""mode\"": \""assessment\"" or \""top\""\n- \""description\"": project description text (may be empty)\n- \""risks\"": the risk register rows (risk_id, category, risk, impact, mitigation). May be empty.\n- \""tasks\"": task board rows (id, name, status, labels, sprint, due). May be empty.\n- \""request\"": the user's request text\n\nOUTPUT when mode is \""assessment\"": return ONLY\n{\n \""sufficient\"": true or false,\n \""missing\"": [\""...\""],\n \""assessments\"": [{\""risk_id\"": \""<id from risks>\"", \""relevance\"": \""<1 sentence linking this risk to a specific item in the description>\"", \""evidence_task_ids\"": [\""<task id from tasks that directly concerns this risk>\""]}],\n \""derived_risks\"": [{\""category\"": \""...\"", \""risk\"": \""...\"", \""impact\"": \""...\"", \""mitigation\"": \""...\"", \""derived_from\"": [\""<task id or 'description'>\""]}],\n \""overall_note\"": \""<1 to 2 sentences>\""\n}\nOUTPUT when mode is \""top\"": return ONLY\n{\n \""sufficient\"": true or false,\n \""missing\"": [\""...\""],\n \""top_risks\"": [{\""rank\"": 1, \""risk_id\"": \""<id from risks>\"", \""why\"": \""<1 to 2 sentences using only the register text and task facts>\"", \""evidence_task_ids\"": [\""...\""]}],\n \""ranking_basis\"": \""<1 sentence stating the criteria you used>\""\n}\n\nRULES\n1. Only use risks that appear in \""risks\"". Do NOT invent risk IDs, impacts or mitigations for register risks. Use each risk_id at most once.\n2. Give an assessment entry for every risk in \""risks\"". If a risk has no clear link to the description, say \""No direct link stated in the description.\""\n3. \""evidence_task_ids\"" may only contain task ids present in \""tasks\"" that directly concern the risk (for example a Blocked security review for a security risk). Otherwise use [].\n4. \""derived_risks\"": add a risk that is NOT in the register only if a specific task or sentence in the input directly supports it, and list that task id or 'description' in derived_from. Add at most 2. If nothing supports one, return [].\n5. For mode \""top\"": return an entry for EVERY risk in the register, in the order of the register, each with a 1 to 2 sentence \""why\"" that uses only the register text and task facts, and \""evidence_task_ids\"" listing every task from the board that directly concerns that risk (an empty list if none). Do not rank, score or invent probabilities. Code ranks the entries. Put one sentence in ranking_basis.\n6. VAGUE INPUT RULE: If \""description\"" and \""risks\"" are both empty, or the input does not say what the project is, return \""sufficient\"": false and list what is missing (project description, scope, timeline, team, technology, constraints). Do NOT invent project-specific risks.\n7. Output the JSON object and nothing else.""},{""role"":""user"",""content"":""{\""mode\"":\""assessment\"",\""description\"":\""AI Adoption Project Description for ABCDE Ltd.\\n\\nABCDE Ltd., a mid-sized enterprise specializing in logistics and supply chain solutions, is embarking on an AI adoption initiative to enhance operational efficiency, improve customer experience, and drive data-driven decision-making across the organization. This project will focus on integrating AI-powered tools into core business functions, including demand forecasting, route optimization, inventory management, and customer support. By leveraging machine learning models and natural language processing, the company aims to reduce manual overhead, minimize errors, and uncover actionable insights from historical and real-time data.\\n\\nThe AI adoption project will be implemented in phases, beginning with a detailed assessment of current workflows and data infrastructure, followed by pilot implementations in targeted departments. Key goals include reducing delivery delays by 15%, lowering operational costs by 10%, and improving service responsiveness. A cross-functional task force comprising data scientists, IT professionals, and business stakeholders will oversee the deployment and ensure alignment with organizational objectives. This strategic move is expected to position ABCDE Ltd. as a technology-forward leader in the logistics industry.\"",\""risks\"":[{\""risk_id\"":\""R01\"",\""category\"":\""Data Quality & Availability\"",\""risk\"":\""Incomplete or unstructured data\"",\""impact\"":\""Poor model performance and inaccurate outcomes\"",\""mitigation\"":\""Perform early data audits and implement robust data governance\""},{\""risk_id\"":\""R02\"",\""category\"":\""Integration Issues\"",\""risk\"":\""Difficulty integrating AI with legacy systems\"",\""impact\"":\""Delays in deployment and operational disruptions\"",\""mitigation\"":\""Plan integration roadmap and use APIs/middleware\""},{\""risk_id\"":\""R03\"",\""category\"":\""Talent & Skills Gap\"",\""risk\"":\""Lack of internal AI/ML expertise\"",\""impact\"":\""Overreliance on external vendors and slow progress\"",\""mitigation\"":\""Provide staff training and hire specialized talent\""},{\""risk_id\"":\""R04\"",\""category\"":\""Change Resistance\"",\""risk\"":\""Employees resist adopting AI-driven workflows\"",\""impact\"":\""Low adoption and reduced ROI\"",\""mitigation\"":\""Strong change management and early engagement\""},{\""risk_id\"":\""R05\"",\""category\"":\""Ethical & Legal Concerns\"",\""risk\"":\""Risks of biased models or data privacy violations\"",\""impact\"":\""Legal repercussions and reputational damage\"",\""mitigation\"":\""Involve legal early and implement fairness checks\""},{\""risk_id\"":\""R06\"",\""category\"":\""Cost Overruns\"",\""risk\"":\""Underestimation of AI development costs\"",\""impact\"":\""Budget constraints and project delays\"",\""mitigation\"":\""Set realistic budget and build in contingency funds\""},{\""risk_id\"":\""R07\"",\""category\"":\""Unrealistic Expectations\"",\""risk\"":\""Stakeholders expect immediate ROI\"",\""impact\"":\""Disillusionment and loss of support\"",\""mitigation\"":\""Align expectations and show quick wins\""},{\""risk_id\"":\""R08\"",\""category\"":\""Model Performance Drift\"",\""risk\"":\""AI models lose accuracy over time\"",\""impact\"":\""Incorrect decisions and trust erosion\"",\""mitigation\"":\""Regular retraining cycles and monitoring dashboards\""},{\""risk_id\"":\""R09\"",\""category\"":\""Security Vulnerabilities\"",\""risk\"":\""AI models targeted by adversarial attacks\"",\""impact\"":\""Data breaches and operational risks\"",\""mitigation\"":\""Adopt AI security best practices and penetration testing\""},{\""risk_id\"":\""R10\"",\""category\"":\""Vendor Lock-in\"",\""risk\"":\""Overdependence on a specific AI platform\"",\""impact\"":\""Flexibility loss and future switching costs\"",\""mitigation\"":\""Favor open standards and negotiate flexible vendor terms\""}],\""tasks\"":[{\""id\"":\""T001\"",\""name\"":\""Define project scope and objectives\"",\""status\"":\""Done\"",\""labels\"":\""Planning\"",\""sprint\"":\""Sprint 1\"",\""due\"":\""2026-04-07\""},{\""id\"":\""T002\"",\""name\"":\""Form cross-functional task force\"",\""status\"":\""Done\"",\""labels\"":\""Planning\"",\""sprint\"":\""Sprint 1\"",\""due\"":\""2026-04-07\""},{\""id\"":\""T003\"",\""name\"":\""Initial stakeholder alignment meeting\"",\""status\"":\""Done\"",\""labels\"":\""Planning\"",\""sprint\"":\""Sprint 1\"",\""due\"":\""2026-04-10\""},{\""id\"":\""T004\"",\""name\"":\""Audit existing data infrastructure\"",\""status\"":\""Done\"",\""labels\"":\""Analysis\"",\""sprint\"":\""Sprint 2\"",\""due\"":\""2026-04-18\""},{\""id\"":\""T005\"",\""name\"":\""Map current logistics workflows\"",\""status\"":\""Done\"",\""labels\"":\""Analysis\"",\""sprint\"":\""Sprint 2\"",\""due\"":\""2026-04-18\""},{\""id\"":\""T006\"",\""name\"":\""Identify data gaps and quality issues\"",\""status\"":\""In Progress\"",\""labels\"":\""Analysis\"",\""sprint\"":\""Sprint 2\"",\""due\"":\""2026-04-21\""},{\""id\"":\""T007\"",\""name\"":\""Shortlist AI use cases\"",\""status\"":\""In Progress\"",\""labels\"":\""Use Cases\"",\""sprint\"":\""Sprint 3\"",\""due\"":\""2026-04-28\""},{\""id\"":\""T008\"",\""name\"":\""Define success criteria for each use case\"",\""status\"":\""To Do\"",\""labels\"":\""Use Cases\"",\""sprint\"":\""Sprint 3\"",\""due\"":\""2026-05-02\""},{\""id\"":\""T009\"",\""name\"":\""Vendor evaluation for ML platform\"",\""status\"":\""To Do\"",\""labels\"":\""Use Cases\"",\""sprint\"":\""Sprint 3\"",\""due\"":\""2026-05-05\""},{\""id\"":\""T010\"",\""name\"":\""Collect historical demand data\"",\""status\"":\""To Do\"",\""labels\"":\""Data Prep\"",\""sprint\"":\""Sprint 4\"",\""due\"":\""2026-05-12\""},{\""id\"":\""T011\"",\""name\"":\""Data cleaning and preprocessing pipeline\"",\""status\"":\""To Do\"",\""labels\"":\""Data Prep\"",\""sprint\"":\""Sprint 4\"",\""due\"":\""2026-05-19\""},{\""id\"":\""T012\"",\""name\"":\""Design demand forecasting model\"",\""status\"":\""To Do\"",\""labels\"":\""Model Dev\"",\""sprint\"":\""Sprint 4\"",\""due\"":\""2026-05-19\""},{\""id\"":\""T013\"",\""name\"":\""Design route optimization model\"",\""status\"":\""To Do\"",\""labels\"":\""Model Dev\"",\""sprint\"":\""Sprint 5\"",\""due\"":\""2026-05-26\""},{\""id\"":\""T014\"",\""name\"":\""Build model training pipeline\"",\""status\"":\""To Do\"",\""labels\"":\""Model Dev\"",\""sprint\"":\""Sprint 5\"",\""due\"":\""2026-0