| Rank | ID | Category | Risk | Potential impact | Mitigation | Why it ranks here | Board evidence |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | R09 | Security Vulnerabilities | AI models targeted by adversarial attacks | Data breaches and operational risks | Adopt AI security best practices and penetration testing | Added by fallback rule: the board has a task directly concerning this risk (see evidence column). | None |
| 2 | R01 | Data Quality & Availability | Incomplete or unstructured data | Poor model performance and inaccurate outcomes | Perform early data audits and implement robust data governance | Added by fallback rule: the board has a task directly concerning this risk (see evidence column). | None |
| 3 | R05 | Ethical & Legal Concerns | Risks of biased models or data privacy violations | Legal repercussions and reputational damage | Involve legal early and implement fairness checks | Added by fallback rule: the board has a task directly concerning this risk (see evidence column). | None |

