**Source:** risk register and task board

| Rank | ID | Category | Risk | Potential impact | Mitigation | Why it ranks here | Board evidence |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | R01 | Data Quality & Availability | Incomplete or unstructured data | Poor model performance and inaccurate outcomes | Perform early data audits and implement robust data governance | Incomplete or unstructured data can lead to poor model performance and inaccurate outcomes, which is critical for the AI adoption project's success. | T004, T006 |
| 2 | R03 | Talent & Skills Gap | Lack of internal AI/ML expertise | Overreliance on external vendors and slow progress | Provide staff training and hire specialized talent | A lack of internal AI/ML expertise could result in overreliance on external vendors and slow progress, hindering the project's objectives. | T020 |
| 3 | R02 | Integration Issues | Difficulty integrating AI with legacy systems | Delays in deployment and operational disruptions | Plan integration roadmap and use APIs/middleware | Difficulty integrating AI with legacy systems may cause delays in deployment and operational disruptions, impacting the overall project timeline. | None |

**Ranking basis:** Risks with a task on the board that concerns them rank first (Blocked, then In Progress, then To Do). Within the same level, the order follows the model's judgement of the stated impact.

The register has no likelihood or severity scores, so no scores are given.

